---
title: Gin Basil Smash
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, gin]
source: Classic cocktail, number 27 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}, press @basil{12%leaves} with @lemon juice{1%fl_oz} until fragrant. Add @gin{2%fl_oz}, @simple syrup{0.75%fl_oz} and ice. Shake hard for ~{10%seconds}, and double strain into a #rocks glass{}(with ice). Garnish with a @basil{1%sprig}.

> Created by Jörg Meyer at Le Lion, Hamburg, in 2008.
